  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like symbol of death, except that all creatures within 60 feet of a symbol of stunning instead become stunned for 1d6 rounds.\n\nNote: Magic traps such as symbol of stunning are hard to detect and disable. A rogue (only) can use the Perception skill to find a symbol of stunning and Disable Device to thwart it. The DC in each case is 25 + spell level, or 32 for symbol of stunning.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like symbol of death, except that all creatures within 60 feet of a symbol of stunning instead become stunned for 1d6 rounds.\\n\\nnote: magic traps such as symbol of stunning are hard to detect and disable. a rogue (only) can use the perception skill to find a symbol of stunning and disable device to thwart it. the dc in each case is 25 + spell level, or 32 for symbol of stunning.\"",
